'''Type 10''' (10式戦車, ''Hitomaru-Shiki Sensha'', '''Type-10 Tank''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Type 10
|image = E 055.png
|appearance = [[Unseen in 2019]]<br>
[[Unseen]]
|money drop = 500¢ - 1,975¢
}}

==Enemy==
Contrary to the original, this new form of the tank sports much lower health in return for the metal trait, making it a much weaker copy of [[Metal Hippoe]].

==Strategy==
Because it deals almost no damage, just spam units such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow]] or [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]]. [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] like [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] or [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] can make work of the tank even faster.

